1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:01,300
Use manual selection

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:02,540
when you have particular

3
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,760
vehicles in mind.

4
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,440
Choose them in Post to

5
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,040
Market and start that batch.

6
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,660
Use Auto-Pilot

7
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:09,960
for the ongoing routine.

8
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,980
Let's find its settings.

9
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:13,870
Click Post to Market

10
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,110
in the left sidebar.

11
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:16,950
Find Auto-Pilot,

12
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,660
then choose Configure.

13
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,740
Set the start and stop

14
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,160
times for your posting window.

15
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,810
Choose which inventory to use,

16
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,260
then your photo options.

17
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:28,030
Read the message about

18
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,640
the window and your account's

19
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,660
daily allowance.

20
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,530
When the settings are right,

21
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,060
turn Auto-Pilot on.

22
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,620
Check that it shows

23
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:36,720
an active state.

24
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,700
It spreads posting across

25
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,760
your chosen window,

26
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:40,780
so you don't have

27
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,260
to start each batch yourself.

28
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:44,340
It also keeps existing

29
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,720
listings up to date.

30
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,500
When a price changes

31
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,800
in your connected inventory,

32
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:50,580
Auto-Pilot can update

33
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,080
the matching Facebook listing

34
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,620
posted through AutoLander.

35
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,040
When a vehicle

36
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,880
is marked sold, it handles

37
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,780
the supported sold update too.

38
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,190
You don't need

39
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:01,210
to sit on the Listing

40
00:01:01,210 --> 00:01:02,580
Updates page and watch.

41
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:04,780
Keep the computer powered on

42
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:06,160
and connected to the internet,

43
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,680
with AutoLander running.

44
00:01:08,270 --> 00:01:09,890
You can minimize the app.

45
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,920
Closing it or shutting down

46
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,640
the computer stops that work.

47
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:15,520
On a laptop, make

48
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,080
sure the computer stays awake.

49
00:01:17,630 --> 00:01:19,190
Check the app each day,

50
00:01:19,190 --> 00:01:20,450
and again after

51
00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:22,130
a restart or lost connection.

52
00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:24,140
Confirm Facebook,

53
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:27,060
the feed and Auto-Pilot, then

54
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:29,120
read any unfinished Queue items.

55
00:01:29,590 --> 00:01:31,230
Which mode fits your day?

56
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:33,390
Note that in your workbook,

57
00:01:33,390 --> 00:01:34,640
then find the schedule

58
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,660
on your own screen.

59
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,300
Change the live

60
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:38,370
settings only when

61
00:01:38,370 --> 00:01:39,540
you're ready to use them.
